    "captions": [
      {
        "from": 0,
        "to": 81,
        "text": "When a patient calls your practice, your team may"
      },
      {
        "from": 81,
        "to": 161,
        "text": "already be helping someone at the desk, taking another"
      },
      {
        "from": 161,
        "to": 214,
        "text": "call, or finishing for the evening."
      },
      {
        "from": 229,
        "to": 275,
        "text": "The patient still needs an answer."
      },
      {
        "from": 284,
        "to": 365,
        "text": "And an appointment inquiry can end before anyone has"
      },
      {
        "from": 365,
        "to": 404,
        "text": "had a useful conversation."
      },
      {
        "from": 425,
        "to": 518,
        "text": "Flow Audit is an AI phone agent configured around"
      },
      {
        "from": 518,
        "to": 535,
        "text": "your practice."
      },
      {
        "from": 555,
        "to": 631,
        "text": "In the recorded demonstration you'll see, it handles an"
      },
      {
        "from": 631,
        "to": 727,
        "text": "appointment inquiry, offers available times, and creates a"
      },
      {
        "from": 727,
        "to": 763,
        "text": "booking in a connected calendar."
      },
      {
        "from": 797,
        "to": 865,
        "text": "It supports your front desk with agreed call workflows"
      },
      {
        "from": 865,
        "to": 894,
        "text": "and human handoffs."
      },
      {
        "from": 909,
        "to": 970,
        "text": "If that could help your practice, book a fifteen-minute"
      },
      {
        "from": 970,
        "to": 986,
        "text": "walkthrough."
      },
      {
        "from": 1003,
        "to": 1074,
        "text": "We'll discuss your requirements, the investment, and whether"
      },
      {
        "from": 1074,
        "to": 1107,
        "text": "you're ready to move forward."
      },
      {
        "from": 1121,
        "to": 1176,
        "text": "Start with your own call records."
      },
      {
        "from": 1195,
        "to": 1262,
        "text": "What happens during busy periods, at lunch, and after"
      },
      {
        "from": 1262,
        "to": 1275,
        "text": "closing?"
      },
      {
        "from": 1293,
        "to": 1362,
        "text": "How many callers are reached later, how many book,"
      },
      {
        "from": 1362,
        "to": 1396,
        "text": "and how many attend?"
      },
      {
        "from": 1409,
        "to": 1439,
        "text": "Those are different measures."
      },
      {
        "from": 1461,
        "to": 1529,
        "text": "A missed call is not automatically a lost patient."
      },
      {
        "from": 1546,
        "to": 1648,
        "text": "For illustration only, suppose five additional appointments were"
      },
      {
        "from": 1648,
        "to": 1737,
        "text": "attended, each with an assumed gross value of one"
      },
      {
        "from": 1737,
        "to": 1769,
        "text": "hundred and fifty dollars."
      },
      {
        "from": 1769,
        "to": 1845,
        "text": "That's seven hundred and fifty dollars in gross appointment"
      },
      {
        "from": 1845,
        "to": 1893,
        "text": "value, before costs."
      },
      {
        "from": 1907,
        "to": 1997,
        "text": "These are hypothetical inputs, not Flow Audit's results or"
      },
      {
        "from": 1997,
        "to": 2010,
        "text": "a forecast."
      },
      {
        "from": 2025,
        "to": 2122,
        "text": "Actual revenue depends on attendance, treatment, collection and"
      },
      {
        "from": 2122,
        "to": 2154,
        "text": "your practice's circumstances."
      },
      {
        "from": 2180,
        "to": 2231,
        "text": "Use your own figures to judge the opportunity."
      },
      {
        "from": 2247,
        "to": 2326,
        "text": "Here's a recorded demonstration using Google Calendar."
      },
      {
        "from": 2348,
        "to": 2408,
        "text": "A new patient wants to register and arrange a"
      },
      {
        "from": 2408,
        "to": 2433,
        "text": "checkup."
      },
      {
        "from": 2433,
        "to": 2531,
        "text": "Listen as the agent clarifies the request, offers appointment"
      },
      {
        "from": 2531,
        "to": 2605,
        "text": "times, and confirms the selected booking."
      },
      {
        "from": 2621,
        "to": 2707,
        "text": "This recording includes short privacy beeps and edited"
      },
      {
        "from": 2707,
        "to": 2743,
        "text": "demonstration labels."
      },
      {
        "from": 2760,
        "to": 2840,
        "text": "[Phone ringing]"
      },
      {
        "from": 2915,
        "to": 2937,
        "text": "Thanks for"
      },
      {
        "from": 2937,
        "to": 2975,
        "text": "[Privacy beep]"
      },
      {
        "from": 2984,
        "to": 3047,
        "text": "I'm Liv, how can I help?"
      },
      {
        "from": 3047,
        "to": 3131,
        "text": "Hiya, I just wanted to ring in and book an appointment."
      },
      {
        "from": 3208,
        "to": 3256,
        "text": "Thanks, can you please tell me"
      },
      {
        "from": 3256,
        "to": 3322,
        "text": "if this is for you or someone else?"
      },
      {
        "from": 3322,
        "to": 3377,
        "text": "It's for me, I'm new in the area,"
      },
      {
        "from": 3377,
        "to": 3448,
        "text": "I want to register with the dentist"
      },
      {
        "from": 3448,
        "to": 3496,
        "text": "and then get checked up as well."
      },
      {
        "from": 3574,
        "to": 3606,
        "text": "Got it, are you looking for"
      },
      {
        "from": 3606,
        "to": 3662,
        "text": "a new patient check-up appointment?"
      },
      {
        "from": 3662,
        "to": 3750,
        "text": "Also, do you have a day or time that suits you best?"
      },
      {
        "from": 3750,
        "to": 3805,
        "text": "Ideally today, if we could do later on today,"
      },
      {
        "from": 3805,
        "to": 3847,
        "text": "that'd be great and yeah,"
      },
      {
        "from": 3847,
        "to": 3906,
        "text": "this would be a new patient check-up."
      },
      {
        "from": 4061,
        "to": 4126,
        "text": "The first available appointment this afternoon"
      },
      {
        "from": 4126,
        "to": 4245,
        "text": "is at 2.30 or three in the afternoon or 3.30."
      },
      {
        "from": 4245,
        "to": 4289,
        "text": "Which one works for you?"
      },
      {
        "from": 4289,
        "to": 4326,
        "text": "Can we do three o'clock?"
      },
      {
        "from": 4420,
        "to": 4475,
        "text": "Thanks, may I have your full name"
      },
      {
        "from": 4475,
        "to": 4547,
        "text": "and the best phone number to reach you on please?"
      },
      {
        "from": 4547,
        "to": 4608,
        "text": "Yeah, my name is Tristan Adams"
      },
      {
        "from": 4608,
        "to": 4698,
        "text": "and the best number to reach me on is this one."
      },
      {
        "from": 4704,
        "to": 4772,
        "text": "[Contact detail privacy beep]"
      },
      {
        "from": 4785,
        "to": 4847,
        "text": "[Contact detail privacy beep]"
      },
      {
        "from": 5056,
        "to": 5111,
        "text": "Your new patient check-up appointment"
      },
      {
        "from": 5111,
        "to": 5197,
        "text": "is booked for Wednesday, the 7th of October"
      },
      {
        "from": 5197,
        "to": 5251,
        "text": "at 3pm."
      },
      {
        "from": 5251,
        "to": 5303,
        "text": "The team has all your details"
      },
      {
        "from": 5303,
        "to": 5352,
        "text": "and looks forward to seeing you then."
      },
      {
        "from": 5352,
        "to": 5402,
        "text": "Is there anything else I can help with?"
      },
      {
        "from": 5402,
        "to": 5475,
        "text": "No, that would be all. Thank you. Bye-bye."
      },
      {
        "from": 5485,
        "to": 5555,
        "text": "You can see the appointment in the calendar and"
      },
      {
        "from": 5555,
        "to": 5582,
        "text": "the recorded request."
      },
      {
        "from": 5603,
        "to": 5660,
        "text": "That's the workflow this example demonstrates."
      },
      {
        "from": 5684,
        "to": 5763,
        "text": "Your scheduling system, appointment types and forwarding"
      },
      {
        "from": 5763,
        "to": 5816,
        "text": "arrangements still need checking."
      },
      {
        "from": 5834,
        "to": 5937,
        "text": "Compatibility is assessed and tested for your practice; it"
      },
      {
        "from": 5937,
        "to": 5991,
        "text": "isn't a promise that every system connects."
      },
      {
        "from": 6010,
        "to": 6055,
        "text": "Some calls need different rules."
      },
      {
        "from": 6081,
        "to": 6158,
        "text": "In this second recorded example, the agent asks about"
      },
      {
        "from": 6158,
        "to": 6228,
        "text": "warning signs, and the caller answers."
      },
      {
        "from": 6254,
        "to": 6315,
        "text": "Is your son experiencing any swelling,"
      },
      {
        "from": 6315,
        "to": 6369,
        "text": "uncontrolled bleeding, trauma,"
      },
      {
        "from": 6369,
        "to": 6425,
        "text": "or trouble breathing or swallowing?"
      },
      {
        "from": 6471,
        "to": 6516,
        "text": "No, none of that."
      },
      {
        "from": 6516,
        "to": 6577,
        "text": "Just that he's complaining about his toothache,"
      },
      {
        "from": 6577,
        "to": 6633,
        "text": "it\u2019s causing him a headache and things of that nature."
      },
      {
        "from": 6633,
        "to": 6659,
        "text": "I just wanna get him checked out"
      },
      {
        "from": 6659,
        "to": 6713,
        "text": "and make sure it's nothing too serious."
      },
      {
        "from": 6721,
        "to": 6816,
        "text": "That question is not evidence of a clinically validated"
      },
      {
        "from": 6816,
        "to": 6896,
        "text": "triage service or a completed emergency handoff."
      },
      {
        "from": 6911,
        "to": 7001,
        "text": "Your practice approves escalation instructions and human handoffs"
      },
      {
        "from": 7001,
        "to": 7025,
        "text": "before activation."
      },
      {
        "from": 7049,
        "to": 7129,
        "text": "The agent supports your team within agreed rules; it"
      },
      {
        "from": 7129,
        "to": 7171,
        "text": "doesn't replace clinical judgment."
      },
      {
        "from": 7192,
        "to": 7293,
        "text": "Privacy, patient-data and security requirements must also be"
      },
      {
        "from": 7293,
        "to": 7323,
        "text": "resolved for your setup."
      },
      {
        "from": 7335,
        "to": 7447,
        "text": "We confirm a deliverable scope, explain the investment and"
      },
      {
        "from": 7447,
        "to": 7492,
        "text": "agree the implementation requirements."
      },
      {
        "from": 7519,
        "to": 7571,
        "text": "If those are clear and you're ready to proceed,"
      },
      {
        "from": 7578,
        "to": 7649,
        "text": "an agreement and initial payment start configuration."
      },
      {
        "from": 7680,
        "to": 7745,
        "text": "We then configure the workflow, test it with your"
      },
      {
        "from": 7745,
        "to": 7840,
        "text": "team, and activate forwarding only after your approval."
      },
      {
        "from": 7858,
        "to": 7965,
        "text": "Unresolved compatibility or review requirements are conditions to"
      },
      {
        "from": 7965,
        "to": 7996,
        "text": "settle before proceeding."
      },
      {
        "from": 8014,
        "to": 8095,
        "text": "Book your fifteen-minute Flow Audit walkthrough."
      },
      {
        "from": 8111,
        "to": 8193,
        "text": "Bring the practice owner or someone authorized to purchase."
      },
      {
        "from": 8212,
        "to": 8286,
        "text": "You'll already have seen the demonstration, so the call"
      },
      {
        "from": 8286,
        "to": 8399,
        "text": "focuses on your practice: the relevant workflow, requirements,"
      },
      {
        "from": 8406,
        "to": 8433,
        "text": "scope and investment."
      },
      {
        "from": 8452,
        "to": 8512,
        "text": "If it's the right fit, we'll discuss getting your"
      },
      {
        "from": 8512,
        "to": 8542,
        "text": "configuration started."
      },
      {
        "from": 8555,
        "to": 8624,
        "text": "For a larger group, we can identify the approvals"
      },
      {
        "from": 8624,
        "to": 8663,
        "text": "and next decision needed."
      },
      {
        "from": 8679,
        "to": 8709,
        "text": "Book your walkthrough below."
      }
    ],
